{"id": "EUVD-2026-97380", "enisaUuid": "02d8c584-be4f-3503-92a1-09e5540d6c4b", "description": "MoguBlog through 6.2 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows authenticated administrators to delete other administrators' files via POST /networkDisk/deleteFile and batchDeleteFile. Attackers can supply another administrator's file or folder uid, which NetworkDiskServiceImpl.deleteFile never checks against admin_uid, removing stored objects from local storage, Qiniu or MinIO.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T13:10:37", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-12T13:10:37", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/mogu_blog_v2/poc_networkDisk_ownership.py", "https://github.com/moxi624/mogu_blog_v2/blob/025d78c7ac7e19b1abf796fa3cc158d855723d15/mogu_picture/src/main/java/com/moxi/mogublog/picture/restapi/NetworkDiskRestApi.java#L97-L120", "https://github.com/moxi624/mogu_blog_v2/blob/025d78c7ac7e19b1abf796fa3cc158d855723d15/mogu_picture/src/main/java/com/moxi/mogublog/picture/service/impl/NetworkDiskServiceImpl.java#L134-L231", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/mogublog-through-6.2-idor-allows-deleting-other-administrators-network-disk-files"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-109176", "GHSA-926c-q529-62wh"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3cad171f-a519-3b3a-a4b7-31d1ec2dd0f5", "product": {"name": "MoguBlog", "vendor": {"name": "moxi624"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22646.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "37bccae6-cbcf-349d-aa69-8f7e15971e60", "vendor": {"name": "moxi624"}}], "isExploited": false}